{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16806","headline":"送王主簿游南海 · 张登","name":"送王主簿游南海","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"平生推久要，留滞共三年。\n明日东南路，穷荒雾露天。\n旷怀常寄酒，素业不言钱。\n道在贫非病，时来丑亦妍。\n过山乘蜡屐，涉海附楼船。\n行矣无爲恨，宗门有大贤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张登","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16806.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16806","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}